<<if equipped() == 0 || equipped() == 1>>
Ah, the detective. I'm sorry, pseudo detective. Or do they give you names?
-> I'm Pseudo Mu
  So they do! I've only seen your type in capital buildings, on my few trips. I have to say I was expecting you. I'm Alfus, Zeta Squad Captain.
  So you know why I'm here? #PSEUDO MU
  Yes, It's unfortunate, but our operation has slowed down because of the accident and at this point we are losing money each hour our drills can't operate.
  Your colleague, i'm sure, was operating above his paygrade and has run off somewhere. Until we locate him, the gate to the main mine shaft will be sealed.
  You may be able to navigate the western mine unaided, but you will need a light source for the eastern mine. Let me know if you have any questions.
  And be careful.
  <<set $alfusMet to 1>>
<<endif>>

<<if equipped() == 2>>
You must be the detective, I must say your have a radiant appearance!
-> I'm Pseudo Mu
  Please to meet you, I'm Alfus, Captain of Zeta Squad. I never thought I'd meet a pseudo-detective in the flesh before. Well, not until recently.
  So you know why I'm here? #PSEUDO MU
  Yes, It's unfortunate, i'm sure you have better things to be doing. This accident, I truly am embarrased it happened under my watch.
  But until this is resolved we can't continue work.
  Your colleague, Breacher I believe, was here earlier but has gone off somewhere. He was quite suspicious of us and rude, unlike you. 
  If you're looking for him, you'll need to get a light source to navigate the eastern mine. It's too perilous without one.
  Is Breacher in the eastern mine? #PSEUDO MU
  No, I mean, you will need a light source to navigate anywhere... thats what I mean... Its quite dangerous you know...
  Let me know if you need anything else...
  <<set $alfusMet to 1>>
<<endif>>
