<<if equipped() == 0 || equipped() == 1>>
You, if only you hadn't shown up. I can't let you get involved here. Lawrence is one thing, we'll do what needs to be done, but we can't stop the mining now.
My sympathy for you has run dry, now leave us.
<<endif>>

<<if equipped() == 2>>
You, when you showed up I wasn't sure what to think. If only we had more time, I feel like Lawrence's memories could be honored. But this situation...
Far from innocent I am, but this feels like a new low. you should steel yourself and escape from here...
<<endif>>

<<if equipped() == 4>>
When you first appeared I had no idea! This, this, this feeling down my spine... What are you? Yes, you must have been the cause of this from the beginning!
Get! Get out of here, quick, someone stop him!
<<endif>>
