---
<<if equipped() == 0 || equipped() == 1>>
Back so soon? Does this mean we can begin work again?
-> About Mining
  The initial reports had so much promise, but we can barely bring up enough Cu prime to keep us working. It must mean we haven't quite hit the main deposit yet.
  If you ask me, I think there may be something else down here they really want us to find.
-> About Breacher
  Have you found him yet?
  I have not #PSEUDO MU
  Well keep looking! I hate to rush you but it is important that we keep moving. I would hate for Lawrence's body to decompose to the point it can't be properly mourned.
-> About the Transport
  What about it? I'm smart enough to not touch mission control property. I wouldn't have even noticed if Sil didn't mention it.
<<endif>>

<<if equipped() == 2>>
-> About Mining
  The initial reports were promising, you see it forecasted a higher than normal chance of Pt prime amongst the Cu. If we get lucky and find a vein...
  Well, lets just say we'll be cashing out.
  The others say I'm crazy, but you know you how workers are. A little overtime never killed anybody. Well I mean, Lawrence...
  But all said and done it paid off if you ask me, just a couple loose ends to tie up
  What did you find?#PSEUDO MU
  No... we... what was I talking about? We didn't find anything... anything yet! I'm sure its just beyond the horizon. We just need to keep drilling.
-> About Breacher
  I wish he hadn't taken my map earlier. I was hoping to re-survey the western mine. But he wanted to see the eastern mines...
  Is that where he is? #PSEUDO MU
  I couldn't tell you, honestly. Trust me.
  Trust you...?#PSEUDO MU
  I mean, trust me to help. Just like Breacher. Wherever he is...
-> About the Transport
  Yea I saw it got damaged. But you can't expect something like that to last long down here. You see those all these crates and carts? There made tough.
  Any old falling rock can't destroy them.
  There wasn't any rocks on the floor by the transport#PSEUDO MU
  Well, I don't know maybe somone was moving something nearby and dinged it, accidents happen...
  Like with a pick axe?#PSEUDO MU
  Did I say that? I mean, it's possible... I'm just trying to stay away... from that area... 
  I don't feel so well, let's talk later...
<<endif>>
